          "text": "这里"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "would"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是 would like，而是 1858 年的人在说：如果平台建成，它将会用作港口和火车站。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 87,
      "start": 564.663,
      "end": 569.311,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "同一类还有："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "This would solve the problem of ventilation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 88,
      "start": 569.661,
      "end": 575.565,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二，工程方案常用被动："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a better plan was put forward"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 89,
      "start": 575.915,
      "end": 579.715,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "重点放在 plan 身上，而不是只盯着谁提出。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 90,
      "start": 580.065,
      "end": 587.045,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "还有："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a double railway-tunnel should be built"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "tall chimneys were built above sea level"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 91,
      "start": 587.394,
      "end": 593.458,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Should be built"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是“应该被建造”，很适合写设计方案。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 92,
      "start": 593.808,
      "end": 602.4,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三，想象一个没有发生的过去："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "If, at the time, the British had not feared invasion, it would have been completed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 93,
      "start": 602.75,
      "end": 608.31,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "真实历史是：they feared invasion, so it was not completed then。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 94,
      "start": 608.66,
      "end": 618.52,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "英语用"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "had not feared"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "加"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "would have been completed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，表达“过去本来可能发生，但没有发生”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 95,
      "start": 618.869,
      "end": 633.549,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天最值得带走的结构是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "would serve as"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "would solve"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was put forward"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "should be built"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，以及"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "If... had not..., it would have been..."
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
